      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f198d590bf1d5023f3f7c9ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦想是“在中央大显身手，\n回应故乡大家的期待”，\n她在日常生活中也默默地崭露斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1a5b902fa9165557690599b38ee2bc0ce7a5aea6a4de974b07117f376ba78b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd8d1ee9e31aab867288fad4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先是以出道战为目标──\n小栗帽的传说即将展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f98b934f0a5825af511d2b3f1d47b29bb424ad6b5178abfe4f19c0ff9e1c38a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2c7e0a438b1aedb79847d70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb055eda22d0af0a94f8c7fff59aafea3a9b9b3e55105005460d70722291629",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f49e3411d965d8e9982a8ca8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽终于要在“出道战”中出赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec60d73a1b7ae94f348256d50b0e23eb9ba00903b9f7a21581617e2b19d53f92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006401.json",
      "json_path": [
