    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbacc3622c03b192b3d21d61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽顺利跑完了出道战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad11437bb145ea02c39fbccfa1cb26f7db057063165fa8b6b2e06d7e5ad71376",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcf6c536a61e5536e73141ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让大家知道“小栗帽来到中央了”，\n她发誓要参加许多比赛，\n以提升知名度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3529fb669277746ae1b67caa8195c276b0a9b73fde6b23c21d19d0c87b9da4c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0084bc956289eb9517580f02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・传到笠松的天空",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ac9883a0460bfa61a5b70372da3986a9ca0128326657a15b56919607b19e84c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3046bc33898ea47f96814a07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "故乡的人们来到\n小栗帽所参加的活动比赛上替她加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeeaf63639569456130ba603e61545cf5c7eeb7afb049d6440ac7a9c094d73d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861df390f4cbc96985a6c812",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽因为意想不到的重逢感到开心，\n却有观众对她说出不经思考的发言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "addc976823e4cf1c91778a37bca3cdcbbae30d4ebef954bfea6830a0afcf7739",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1974cdc50f6d159d112c96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让支持她的人放心，\n小栗帽在赛道上奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5aa58c5083d432ea2843444df590fa850c1dde31f1bc8d8f80059bcdfbe46e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0537c655169bd453ecdf0f3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她漂亮地轻松获胜，\n展现了实力的差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88531631a7cb670d0655950f666ad869c5cb1ba305afea988f2ce10a1e35ddee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006403.json",
