    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec14f75c86c6fbe8e2b28067",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽接受了记者的采访，\n她因为没有答好而感到沮丧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43f4713ffa39620d165ac52484c263a6e0c06cc0f66f2f4e8e01c5c73925a1cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:560834ac5a3b2b994d2578c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早她一步出道的玉藻十字\n以前辈的身份给了小栗帽建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "541f9fb44e46f5a35fb42981ecd08b7e34edbb5b08c94ef9ace7e58ec0480967",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c504cf61375adf6d7c778d58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽察觉到了重要的事情，\n并在后来的记者会上说出自己的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc87c73f86e31f1c022da3bb15400906030baa459dfe18275b4b04ad4191e22d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
