      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15cd75ddfacd14258b4182f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标达成后・心跳加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "b98fbd0439901f5dba3b912665955a78b7e7c789fdf198e41abcce3ce35b49bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e9e544a158ad8ec608e710",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽训练到一半的时候，\n有几位赛马娘来到了她身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a2b42b56c7c31e6e2a88e57fcd7a06fa7f79c726782ffb1921df55332f5592a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b40857c974da3f13980a42",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "备受瞩目的稻荷一和玉藻十字──\n以及超级溪流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a12544c94d823f7dfabe5cd24a82edae66160d315ea31893fed0cd5501081a8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ceb36df87b381e0ab0aad13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽和超级溪流\n在旁人眼中互为敌人，\n但双方却都像在状况外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d8ab6bf32967395c078a1141edf43bc81eb6111925a58a9bb4c9bd5e228bb07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36442420e200e38e81dff4fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "瞩目赛马娘，集结",
